					"source": "\\section*{Friedmann-Robertson-Walker}\n\nThis example starts from the Friedmann-Robertson-Walker metric for a homogeneous and isotropic universe, to derive the Friedmann equations. We start by declaring indices. We also introduce some shorthand notations to display derivatives using dots."
