					"source": "\\begin{dmath*}{}\\left[g_{t t} = -\\,1, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{r r} = \\frac{{a}^{2\\,}}{\\left(1\\discretionary{}{}{}-\\,k {r}^{2\\,}\\right)}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\theta \\theta} = {a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,}, \\discretionary{}{}{}g_{\\phi \\phi} = {a}^{2\\,} {r}^{2\\,} {\\left(\\sin{\\theta}\\right)}^{2\\,}\\right]\\end{dmath*}"
				}
			],
			"source": "metric:= { g_{t t} = -1, \n           g_{r r} = a**2 / (1 - k r**2), \n           g_{\\theta\\theta} = a**2 r**2, \n           g_{\\phi\\phi} = a**2 r**2 \\sin(\\theta)**2 };"
