							"source": "G_{\\mu \\nu} = \\components_{\\mu \\nu}({{t, t} = 3(-k-(\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (a)**(-2), {r, r} = (-k-2a \\partial_{t t}(a)-(\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (k (r)**2-1)**(-1), {\\theta, \\theta} = (r)**2 (k + 2a \\partial_{t t}(a) + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2), {\\phi, \\phi} = (r)**2 (k + 2a \\partial_{t t}(a) + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (\\sin(\\theta))**2})"
