							"source": "G^{\\mu}_{\\nu} = \\components_{\\nu}^{\\mu}({{t, t} = 3(k + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (a)**(-2), {r, r} = (k + 2a \\partial_{t t}(a) + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (a)**(-2), {\\theta, \\theta} = (k + 2a \\partial_{t t}(a) + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (a)**(-2), {\\phi, \\phi} = (k + 2a \\partial_{t t}(a) + (\\partial_{t}(a))**2) (a)**(-2)})"
